      "markdown": " $$ P_{x}=\\frac{w}{t} $$ \n\n $$ w=\\frac{n}{N}\\times3.6\\times10^{6} 瓦秒 $$ \n\n $ P_{x} $ ——被测功率 W;\n\nw——电度表累积测得电能；\n\nN——电度表每千瓦时盘转动数：\n\nn——电度表的转数 转：\n\nt——测量时间 s\n\n## 3 方差与传播系数\n\n $$ u^{2}\\big(P_{x}\\big)=\\left(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial w}\\right)^{2}u^{2}\\big(w\\big)+\\left(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial t}\\right)^{2}u^{2}\\big(t\\big)=c^{2}\\big(w\\big)u^{2}\\big(w\\big)+c^{2}\\big(t\\big)u^{2}\\big(t\\big) $$ \n\n $$ c(w)=\\frac{1}{t} $$ \n\n $$ c(t)=-\\frac{w}{t^{2}} $$ \n\n $$ u^{2}\\big(P_{x}\\big)=\\frac{1}{t^{2}}u^{2}\\big(w\\big)\\div\\frac{w^{2}}{t^{4}}u^{2}\\big(t\\big) $$ \n\n $$ \\left(\\frac{u\\left(P_{x}\\right)}{P_{x}}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{u^{2}\\left(w\\right)}{w^{2}}+\\frac{u^{2}\\left(t\\right)}{t^{2}} $$ \n\n## 本不确定度分析以榨汁机为例\n\n## 4 标准不确定度一览表\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">表 4-1</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">标准不确定度一览表</div>\n\n\n\n<table border=1 style='margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;'><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>标准不确定度分量  $ u_{i} $</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>不确定度来源</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>标准不确定度值</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>$ c_{i}=\\tilde{c}_{f}/\\tilde{c}_{x_{i}} $</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>$ |c_{i}|\\times u(x_{i}) $</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>自由度</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>$ u_{1} $</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>重复性误差</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>0.2%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>1</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>0.2%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>2</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>$ u_{2} $</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>表头示值误差</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>0.29%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>1</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>0.29%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>50</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>$ u_{3} $</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>电子秒表误差</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>0.02%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>1</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>0.02%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>8</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\">$ u_{c}(P_{x})=0.35\\% $  $ v_{eff}=16 $</td></tr></table>",
